<p>Hayya ala qairil amal hayya ala qairil amal</p>

<p>
lo aagaya mahe aza hayya ala qairil amal.</p>

<p>aur bichgayi farshe aza hayya ala qairil amal.</p>

<p>
1. Phir rounaqe hamaare gharaane me aagayi.</p>

<p>(hayya alal aza, hayya alal buka).</p>

<p>ghar ghar hai matam ki sada hayya ala qairil amal</p>

<p>
2. Aaho buka o matame sarwar a.s ki shakl me.</p>

<p>(hayya alal aza, hayya alal buka).</p>

<p>you'n ajre risaalat ho ada hayya ala qairil amal.</p>

<p>
 3. Hai zindagi to bas isi matam ke waaste.</p>

<p>(hayya alal aza, hayya alal buka).</p>

<p>Jaane'n hamari ho fida hayya ala qairil amal</p>

<p>
4. Matam yeh ruk na paayega Zehra (s.a) ke laal ka.</p>

<p>(hayya alal aza, hayya alal buka) </p>

<p>Ye Syeda (s.a) ki hai dua hayya ala qairil amal</p>

<p>
5. Gham me Hussain (asws) ke jo rulayega royega</p>

<p>(hayya alal aza, hayya alal buka).</p>

<p>Raazi hain usse Fatima (s.a) hayya ala qairil amal.</p>

<p>
6. Qushnoodi e Khuda o Aimma(asws) ke waaste.</p>

<p>(hayya alal aza, hayya alal buka).</p>

<p>Majlis karo ghar mein bapa hayya alaa khairil amal.</p>

<p>
7. <b>Mirza Kumail</b> karti hai aelaan <b>Asghari</b></p>

<p>(hayya alal-aza, hayya alal-buka).</p>

<p>Matam karo shabbir (asws) ka hayya alaa qairil amal</p>